        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Salt Spring Community Showcase 2026, Live at ArtSpring – April 17, 2026 | 7:30 PM One night. Endless talent. All Salt Spring. Get ready for an unforgettable evening of creativity, [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
