        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Fri May 22, 7:00pm | Celebrate the joy of youth music making and come check out the Makana Choir’s Spring concert! As usual with a Makana concert, the choirs learn [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
