    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "MET OPERA: El Último Sueño de Frida y Diego (Frank)"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Sat May 30, 10am | On May 30, the Metropolitan Opera’s 2025–26 Live in HD season comes to a close with a live transmission of American composer Gabriela Lena Frank’s first opera, a magical-realist portrait of Mexico’s painterly power couple Frida Kahlo and Diego Rivera, with libretto by Pulitzer Prize–winning playwright Nilo Cruz. Fashioned as a reversal [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ],
