        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Tue Apr 28, 7:30 | Siblings Bryan and Silvie Cheng—known internationally as the Cheng² Duo (pronounced Cheng Squared)—bring an electrifying chemistry to the stage that transcends classical tradition. Their artistry, praised as “brilliant” (The Sunday Times) and “absolutely captivating” (Pizzicato Magazine), blends youthful energy with technical mastery and emotional depth. JUNO-nominated and celebrated worldwide for [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
