t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tJune 4, 2024\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t - \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t2025-12-01\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tNow\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\tSelect date.\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tNovember 2025\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSat\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t1\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tNovember 1, 2025 @ 10:00 am - November 30, 2025 @ 2:00 pm\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\tNew and Selected Paintings by Margarite Sánchez\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tLobby Exhibition: New and Selected Paintings by Margarite Sánchez\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Lobby\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tWhy not celebrate the beauty that surrounds us, the love that connects us, and the preciousness of this wild and beautiful life? This collection of original oil paintings, by Margarite Sánchez, reflects on the extraordinary and ordinary moments that make this ephemeral existence so rich. Through the tender vulnerability of the human body, the lush […]\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tOctober 2025\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tWed\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t1\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tOctober 1, 2025 @ 10:00 am - October 30, 2025 @ 2:00 pm\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\tLobby Exhibition: Pretty, Not Pretty\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tLobby Exhibition: Pretty, Not Pretty\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Lobby\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tThe fine-art photography exhibition \"Pretty NOT Pretty\" showcases the innovative works of artists Judy H McPhee and Anette Schrage, who each explore their unique interpretations of beauty. Through their lenses, they capture a diverse array of subjects, ranging from mundane everyday items to overlooked discarded objects, inviting viewers to reconsider conventional notions of beauty. This […]\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tSeptember 2025\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tFri\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t12\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\tFeatured\n\t\n\t\tSeptember 12, 2025 @ 3:30 pm - 5:30 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tMAKANA YOUTH CHOIRS: Fall Term\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Lobby\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tFridays, Sep 12-Nov 21 |The Makana Choirs are the place to develop healthy singing habits, learn musical literary skills, and put on a concert. All while having fun with friends! Makana is directed by Caroni Young and accompanied by Cicela Månsson. ++ The Makana Kids Class is for singers in grades 2-5. This class is […]\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t$150\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tMon\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t1\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tSeptember 1, 2025 @ 10:00 am - September 30, 2025 @ 2:00 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tLobby Exhibition: Seth Berkowitz Presents Open Spaces\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Lobby\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tEmpty Spaces is a photographic meditation on the social landscape, explored through scenes where human presence is absent but deeply felt. These images—of deserted streets, vacant interiors, and peripheral zones—highlight the traces of daily life and our collective behavior, values, and absences. The work considers emptiness not as void, but as a charged condition—where silence […]\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tJune 2025\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tWed\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t4\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tJune 4, 2025 @ 10:00 am - July 10, 2025 @ 2:00 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tSweetgrass Arts & Music presents SS Island Indigenous Art Show: Lobby Exhibition\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Lobby\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tA vibrant and diverse showcase by local Indigenous and Métis artists, featuring traditional and contemporary expressions. Explore intricate beadwork in the Métis floral style, eco art prints made from natural materials, pyrography (wood burning), as well as acrylic and watercolor paintings that reflect personal and cultural stories. Sculptural pieces add a three-dimensional element to the […]\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tMay 2025\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tThu\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t1\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tMay 1, 2025 @ 10:00 am - May 30, 2025 @ 4:00 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tLobby Exhibition: Reflections\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Lobby\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tPacifis Sands Resort Tofino Reflections is a collection of photographic works amassed over the past quarter century. These images explore the varying temperatures of the sun's refraction across the globe and are influenced by the deep tonality and colours of nature. People, place, colour, and space converge in these compositions to evoke a sense of […]\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tApril 2025\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tThu\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t3\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tApril 3, 2025 @ 10:00 am - April 30, 2025 @ 4:00 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tFemme Frequency: Lobby Exhibition\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Lobby\t\n\t\n