bel\":\"Export Outlook .ics file\",\"single_label\":\"Export Outlook .ics file\",\"visible\":true,\"block_slug\":null}},\"display_recurring_toggle\":false,\"_context\":{\"slug\":\"organizer\"},\"text\":\"Loading...\",\"classes\":[\"tribe-common-c-loader__dot\",\"tribe-common-c-loader__dot--third\"]}\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\tGISS Music\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t« All Events\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\tEvents from this organizer\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\tToday\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t2014-06-11\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tJune 11, 2014\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t - \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t2025-12-01\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tNow\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\tSelect date.\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tJune 2014\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tWed\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t11\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tJune 11, 2014 @ 7:30 pm - 9:00 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tGISS MUSIC\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Theatre\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tGISS Music presents two nights of almost entirely original music created in class by GISS students over the duration of the semester. The jazz combo will feature two original works and one arrangement, a classic Summertime and Haitian Fight Song, woven together with beautiful solos by Liam Sinclair and others. The Senior Composition students will […]\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t$12\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tJanuary 2015\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tThu\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t15\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tJanuary 15, 2015 @ 7:30 pm - 9:00 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tGISS Music\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Theatre\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tGISS Music presents a night of music by talented local students. The concert features the junior composition class, the mixed choir, GISPA Music students, and Mudd - the newly formed vocal group.\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t$14\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tJune 2015\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tWed\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t3\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tJune 3, 2015 @ 7:30 pm - 8:40 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tGISS MUSIC: YEAR-END SHOW\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Theatre\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tGISS Music's year-end show features the hard work of the high school music student choirs and senior composition class with some GISPA music and guitar included for good measure! The show starts at 7:30 p.m. with a draw for prizes in a basket on the first night of two \"super phaat sonic treat\" runs.\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t$12\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tJanuary 2016\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tThu\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t21\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tJanuary 21, 2016 @ 7:30 pm - 8:45 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tGISS MUSIC\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Theatre\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tThe mid-year Gulf Islands Secondary School Music Department presents a collection of original and cover material by the Junior Composition class with a smoldering bite-size of GISPA music intertwined in the concert. To end the evening listen to a little a cappella royalty with Freddie Mercury's Bohemian Rhapsody. Come and enjoy the sonic surprises of these talented young musicians. […]\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t$10.00 – $15\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tJune 2016\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tWed\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t8\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tJune 8, 2016 @ 7:15 pm - 8:30 pm\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\tGISS MUSIC: SPIRITS\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tGISS MUSIC: SPIRITS\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Theatre\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tGISS Music presents Spirits, a really big show comprised of the senior composition class, and selections from the guitar class, choir and GISPA music students. To round off the evening, there will also be a couple of solos. Please note, the show begins at 7:15 pm\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t$12\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tJanuary 2017\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTue\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t24\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tJanuary 24, 2017 @ 7:00 pm - 8:30 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tGISS Music: Mad World\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Theatre\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tIt's cold out there! Warm up to the sounds of GISS Music department with this one night only performance. The performance includes selections from the Junior composition class, small ensembles, some beautiful solos, choir and GISPA music. Come and take a listen to this talented bunch of musicians.\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tJune 2018\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tWed\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t13\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tJune 13, 2018 @ 7:30 pm - 9:00 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tGISS Music Year End Performance\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Theatre\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tThe GISS music department will give a year end perfor