    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;IGNITE: Advanced Storytelling for the Fearless Creator with Deb Williams Fri May 1 | 10am-4pm Sat May 2 | 10am-4pm Sun May 3 | 10am-4pm Sun May 3 | Public Performance 7:30pm  IGNITE is a three-day immersive, experiential workshop where advanced creators dive deep into personal narratives, refine their storytelling voice, and craft high-impact stories, [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
