Spring Film Festival\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"http://saltspringfilmfestival.com\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"http://saltspringfilmfestival.com\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"14 \\u2013 15\",\"priceCurrency\":\"CAD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/salt-spring-film-festival-presents-the-art-of-adventure-matinee/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-10-21T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring RoundTable Presents &#8211; What These Eyes Have Seen &#8211; Film &#038; Music Evening\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Sunday, November 9, 2025 | 7:00 PM | By Donation As part of the What These Eyes Have Seen \\u2013 Witness to War exhibition, join us for an engaging evening that blends documentary film with live music in a tribute to veterans and their families. This special event showcases a selection of locally-produced short films [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/DSC_7286-Artspring-version-II-sRGB-c-Bibby.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/artspring-roundtable-presents-what-these-eyes-have-seen-witness-to-war-2/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-11-09T19:00:00-08:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-11-09T21:30:00-08:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"http://www.artspring.ca\",\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"email\":\"t&#105;&#99;&#107;e&#116;s&#64;&#97;&#114;t&#115;&#112;&#114;i&#110;g&#46;c&#97;\",\"sameAs\":\"http://www.artspring.ca\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"MET OPERA: La Boh\\u00e8me (Puccini)\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Sat Nov 8, 10am | With its enchanting setting and spellbinding score, the world\\u2019s most popular opera is as timeless as it is heartbreaking. Franco Zeffirelli\\u2019s picture-perfect production brings 19th-century Paris to the Met stage as Puccini\\u2019s young friends and lovers navigate the joy and struggle of bohemian life. Soprano Juliana Grigoryan is the feeble [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/2-1.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/met-opera-la-boheme-puccini/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-11-08T10:00:00-08:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-11-08T13:30:00-08:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"15 \\u2013 25\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/met-opera-la-boheme-puccini/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-08-28T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"SSI Foundation Presents Understanding Family Generational Wealth\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Hear bestselling author Tom Deans speak about the Family Wealth Transfer movement and how to better understand your family\\u2019s generational wealth. One of Canada\\u2019s preeminent thought leaders who has delivered over 2000 speeches globally, Dr. Deans\\u2019 will share ideas from his engaging books including Every Family\\\\'s Business, Willing Wisdom, and The Happy Inheritor. Canada is [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/ss-foundation-presents-understanding-family-generational-wealth/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-11-07T15:00:00-08:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-11-07T18:00:00-08:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Salt Spring Island Foundation\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://ssifoundation.ca/\",\"telephone\":\"250.537.8305\",\"email\":\"inf&#111;&#64;s&#115;i&#102;&#111;&#117;nd&#97;&#116;io&#110;.&#99;&#97;\",\"sameAs\":\"https://ssifoundation.ca/\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"88 STRINGS: Crossover\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Tue Nov 4, 7:30pm | A meeting of musical worlds, 88 Strings is a remarkable Canadian quartet that blends Chinese, Persian, and Western plucked string instruments into a mesmerizing soundscape. Described by one listener as \\u201cplucked string heaven,\\u201d the ensemble weaves classical, traditional, and newly commissioned works into rich, meditative concerts that feel both ancient [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/3.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/88-strings-crossover/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-11-04T19:30:00-08:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-11-04T21:30:00-08:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"10 \\u2013 42\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/88-strings-crossover/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-09-01T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"SS Forum &#8211; Daniel Bodansky &#8211; Judgement Time: Climate Change and the International Court of Justice\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Daniel Bodansky is Regents\\u2019 Professor of Law at Arizona State University and formerly served as U.S. State Department Climate Change Coordinator (1999\\u20132001). His work has shaped climate diplomacy at both national and international levels. He is the author of The Art and Craft of International Environmental Law (Harvard University Press), and co-author of International Climate [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/ss-forum-daniel-bodansky-judgement-time-climage-change-and-the-international-court-of-justice/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-11-02T15:00:00-08:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-11-02T16:30:00-08:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Salt Spring Forum\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"http://saltspringforum.ca/\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"http://saltspringforum.ca/\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"20 \\u2013 25\",\"priceCurrency\":\"CAD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/ss-forum-daniel-bodansky-judgement-time-climage-change-and-the-international-court-of-justice/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-09-17T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"THE GEEZERS &#8212; EXPECT DELAYS\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Let\\u2019s face it\\u2014Salt Spring traffic isn\\u2019t the only outrageous thing on this Island. Buckle up and let The Geezers, Sid Filkow and Patrick Cassidy, take you on a comedy joyride as they navigate the potholes of Island life\\u2014and life itself. Think Monty Python colliding head-on with the Three Stooges. This show honours the comedy legacy [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/the-geezers-expect-delays/2025-10-30/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-10-30T19:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-10-30T21:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Graffiti Theatre\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"15 \\u2013 30\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/the-geezers-expect-delays/2025-10-30/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-09-08T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Salt Spring Film Festival presents HAVE YOU HEARD JUDI SINGH?\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Trailblazing jazz singer Judi Singh defied expectations as a Canadian artist of mixed Black &amp; Punjabi heritage in the 1950s and \\u201860s, playing to sold-out crowds in Edmonton. Though her ethereal, pitch-perfect voice captivated adoring audiences, the music industry failed to support her career \\u2013 an all-too-familiar story for women and artists of colour \\u2013 [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/salt-spring-film-festival-presents-have-you-heard-judi-singh/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-10-29T19:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-10-29T22:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Salt Spring Film Festival\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"http://saltspringfilmfestival.com\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"http://saltspringfilmfestival.com\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"14 \\u2013 15\",\"priceCurrency\":\"CAD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/salt-spring-film-festival-presents-have-you-heard-judi-singh/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-09-12T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"FUNNY, YOU DON&#8217;T LOOK AUTISTIC\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Fri Oct 24, 7:30pm | Part stand-up, part storytelling, and all heart, this sharp solo show by autistic comedian and author Michael McCreary explores the misconceptions and everyday realities of life on the spectrum. Based on his hit memoir, Funny, You Don\\u2019t Look Autistic\\u00a0blends McCreary\\u2019s signature deadpan humour with Green Thumb Theatre\\u2019s legacy of bold, [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/6.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/funny-you-dont-look-autistic/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-10-24T19:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-10-24T21:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"10 \\u2013 42\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/funny-you-dont-look-autistic/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-09-01T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"100 Women Who Care Meeting\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring welcomes the 100+ Women Who Care, Salt Spring chapter, on Thursday, October for its tri-annual meeting and vote. Member check-in is from 6:30pm-7pm, with three five-minute presentations representing nominated local charities starting at 7pm in the theatre. Voting occurs immediately following and the majority winner is announced. The successful candidate will receive up to [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/100-women-who-care-meeting-5/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-10-23T18:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-10-23T20:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"SSNAP Closing Gala &#038; Awards\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Join us for the SSNAP 2025 Closing Gala and Awards on Saturday, October 18, from 5\\u201310pm at ArtSpring Theatre on Salt Spring Island. This culminating event celebrates the very best in Canadian contemporary art and brings together SSNAP and PAS finalists, jurors, art supporters, and community members for an inspiring evening of recognition and connection. [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/ssnap-closing-gala-awards/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-10-18T17:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-10-18T22:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"SSNAP\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"http://saltspringartprize.ca/\",\"telephone\":\"250-931-1141\",\"email\":\"in&#102;o&#64;salt&#115;p&#114;ingar&#116;&#112;&#114;i&#122;&#101;.ca\",\"sameAs\":\"http