itle heroine, a young noblewoman in search of love on her own […]\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t$15 – $25\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tWed\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t19\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\tFeatured\n\t\n\t\tNovember 19, 2025 @ 7:30 pm - 9:30 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tTAKE THIS WALTZ: Celebrating the Music of Leonard Cohen\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Theatre\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tWed Nov 19, 7:30pm | Experience Leonard Cohen’s music like never before in this rich, multidisciplinary tribute from choreographer Idan Cohen and Ne. Sans Opera & Dance. Blending live performance, contemporary dance, and stunning visual design, this evocative performance stars acclaimed Canadian bass-baritone Daniel Okulitch, lauded by Opera News as “flat-out brilliant,” alongside versatile dancer/musician […]\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t$10 – $42\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tMon\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t17\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tNovember 17, 2025 @ 2:30 pm - 4:30 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tVetta Chamber Music Presents: Concert 2 – STIRRINGS, Harp and Strings\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Theatre\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tA warm welcome back to harpist Rita Costanzi, one of Vetta’s original featured artists. Experience her dramatic artistry alongside strings in evocative works that span eras and continents. Marcel Tournier | Vers la source dans le bois for solo harp Alexander Borodin | String Quartet No. 2 in D major Claude Debussy | Danse sacrée […]\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t$30 – $35\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSun\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t16\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t