        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t18 events found.\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\n[{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"MET OPERA NOW ON SALE: La Sonnambula (AP)\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;SIX OPERAS NOW ON SALE | First up -- Sat Oct. 18 10am | Following triumphant Live in HD\\u00a0performances in Gounod\\u2019s\\u00a0Rom\\u00e9o\\u00a0et\\u00a0Juliette, Verdi\\u2019s\\u00a0La\\u00a0Traviata, and Donizetti\\u2019s\\u00a0Lucia\\u00a0di\\u00a0Lammermoor, Nadine Sierra summits another peak of the soprano repertoire as Amina, who sleepwalks her way into audiences\\u2019 hearts in Bellini\\u2019s poignant tale of love lost and found. In his new production, [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/1.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/met-opera-la-sonnambula-ap/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-10-18T10:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-10-18T13:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"15 \\u2013 25\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/met-opera-la-sonnambula-ap/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-08-28T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"HIROMOTO IDA: Vacant Lot\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Fri Oct 17, 7:30pm |In this poignant and poetic dance-theatre work by Hiromoto Ida (Sh\\u014dgun,\\u00a0The Man in the High Castle) a long-married couple revisits the now-empty lot where their family home once stood. What begins as a tender sharing of memories gradually opens into a meditation on time, impermanence, and the fragility of life itself. [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/5.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/hiromoto-ida-vacant-lot/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-10-17T19:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-10-17T21:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"10 \\u2013 42\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/hiromoto-ida-vacant-lot/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-09-01T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"ANGELA CHENG: Beloved Treasures\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Tue Oct 14, 7:30pm | Widely hailed as one of Canada\\u2019s most distinguished pianists, Angela Cheng brings dazzling technique, expressive depth, and a luminous touch to every performance. A gold medalist at the Arthur Rubinstein Piano Masters Competition and the first Canadian to win the Montreal International Piano Competition, Cheng has performed at Carnegie Hall, [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/2.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/angela-cheng-prisms/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-10-14T19:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-10-14T21:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"10 \\u2013 42\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/angela-cheng-prisms/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-09-01T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"BANFF CENTRE MOUNTAIN FILM FESTIVAL\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Fri Oct 10, 7pm | Sat Oct 11, 2pm | A sell-out two years in a row! This year, ArtSpring has selected TWO different curated packages of top films including award-winners and audience favourites sure to connect with our community. Traveling to remote vistas, analyzing topical environmental issues, and bringing audiences up-close and personal with [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/4.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/banff-centre-mountain-film-festival-2/2025-10-11/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-10-11T14:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-10-11T17:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"10 \\u2013 20\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/banff-centre-mountain-film-festival-2/2025-10-11/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-09-01T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"The Great Divide: Canada&#8217;s Tribute To The Band\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;The Great Divide perform the music of The Band from their careers with Bob Dylan, through Music From Big Pink and up to The Last Waltz. The Great Divide enjoy the same versatility as The Band with five vocalists (including their drummer), both a piano player and organist, and they are all multi-instrumentalists. Performing with [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/the-great-divide-canadas-tribute-to-the-band/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-10-04T19:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-10-04T21:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Cascadia Concerts\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"25 \\u2013 44\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/the-great-divide-canadas-tribute-to-the-band/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-08-06T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Salt Spring Film Festival presents HOME IS THE OCEAN\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Sail away with Dario &amp; Sabine Schw\\u00f6rer, an adventurous mountain-climbing couple living aboard their sailboat for the past 25 years, sailing over 100,000 nautical miles and visiting over 100 countries. Founders of the Swiss-based TOPtoTOP Global Climate Expedition \\u2013 whose mission is to inspire young people to save the planet \\u2013 the Schw\\u00f6rers conduct field-based [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/salt-spring-film-festival-presents-home-is-the-ocean/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-10-01T19:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-10-01T21:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Salt Spring Film Festival\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"http://saltspringfilmfestival.com\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"http://saltspringfilmfestival.com\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"14 \\u2013 15\",\"priceCurrency\":\"CAD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/salt-spring-film-festival-presents-home-is-the-ocean/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-09-08T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Vetta Chamber Music Presents: BEGINNINGS | The Vetta String Quartet\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;In the beginning was Vetta\\u2019s founding String Quartet. We open our celebratory 40th Anniversary season with a program honouring those early years\\u2014featuring a Canadian gem by Kelly Marie Murphy and two powerful classics that have shaped Vetta\\u2019s journey. Kelly Marie Murphy | Dark Matter Dmitri Shostakovich | String Quartet No. 8 in C minor, Op. [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/vetta-chamber-music-presents-beginnings-the-vetta-string-quartet/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-09-29T14:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-09-29T16:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Vetta\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"30 \\u2013 35\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/vetta-chamber-music-presents-beginnings-the-vetta-string-quartet/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-04-23T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Caravan World Rhythms Presents SEFFARINE &#8211; Music of Andalucia and Morocco with flamenco dancer Manuel Gutierrez\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Caravan World Rhythms Presents Seffarine - Music of Andalucia and Morocco with flamenco dancer Manuel Gutierrez Charged with texture and color, Seffarine concerts carry the audience on a vibrant musical journey, channeling the heart-wrenching joy of the music and dance of North Africa and southern Spain to wide acclaim. Born in the ancient city of [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/seffarine-music-of-spain-morocco-and-the-middle-east-with-flamenco-dancer-manuel-gutierrez/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-09-27T19:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-09-27T21:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Caravan World Rhythms\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"20 \\u2013 40\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/seffarine-music-of-spain-morocco-and-the-middle-east-with-flamenco-dancer-manuel-gutierrez/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-05-22T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"CHARLES RICHARD-HAMELIN\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Fri Sep 26, 7:30pm | Renowned for his poetic touch and commanding presence, Charles Richard-Hamelin is one of Canada\\u2019s most celebrated classical pianists. A silver medalist at the 2015 International Chopin Piano Competition and winner of the Krystian Zimerman Prize, he has since performed with major orchestras around the world under the baton of Yannick [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/charles-richard-hamelin/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-09-26T19:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-09-26T21:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"10 \\u2013 42\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/charles-richard-hamelin/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-09-01T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Mary Jane&#8217;s Last Dance &#8212; Tom Petty Tribute\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;MARYJANE\\\\'S LAST DANCE Canada\\u2019s Ultimate Tribute to Tom Petty &amp; The Heartbreakers! Founded in 2010, Steve Mathieson whose remarkable skill and talent captures the true spirit of Tom Petty with the help of his amazing band MARYJANE\\u2019S LAST DANCE! They have performed their memorable tribute to Tom Petty &amp; The Heartbreakers in sold-out shows of [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/mary-janes-last-dance-tom-petty-tribute/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-09-19T19:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-09-19T21:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"MaryJane&#8217;s Last Dance\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"40\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/mary-janes-last-dance-tom-petty-tribute/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-05-28T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"SS Forum: Ginger Gosnell-Myers &#8212; New Perspectives of Indigenous Peoples in Cities\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Ginger Gosnell-Myers is a Fellow at the Morris J Wosk Centre for Dialogue at SFU. She explores the aspirations for Indigenous city building, and contemporary Indigenous issues that impact Indigenous peoples across the country. She was Vancouver\\\\'s first Indigenous relations manager where she was instrumental in the city becoming the world\\\\'s first official City of [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/ss-forum-ginger-gosnell-myers-new-perspectives-of-indigenous-peoples-in-cities/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-09-18T19:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-09-18T21:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Salt Spring Forum\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"http://saltspringforum.ca/\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"http://saltspringforum.ca/\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"20 \\u2013 25\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/ss-forum-ginger-gosnell-myers-new-perspectives-of-indigenous-peoples-in-cities/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-07-22T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"SWEETGRASS ARTS AND MUSIC INDIGENOUS SHOWCASE\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;SAT SEP 13 | 7:00pm | Sweetgrass Arts and Music Indigenous Showcase Presented by Sweetgrass Arts and Music Society in partnership with ArtSpring RoundTable Committee We kick off the night with the soulful sounds of Kai Barrette, a rising local youth artist whose vocals and guitar work promise to stir the heart and set the [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Untitled-design.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/sweetgrassshowcase/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-09-13T19:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-09-13T22:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"10 \\u2013 30\",\"priceCurrency\":\"CAD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/sweetgrassshowcase/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-08-15T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"2025/26 Season Launches\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;TUE SEP 2 | Ticket sales open for members in person on Tuesday September 2, 10am-4pm before being made available to members online at 10am Wednesday. General public sales open Tuesday September 9th. Explore our 100% all-Canadian ArtSpring Presents programming of dance, music, theatre, community workshops and initiatives, and some very special surprise national and [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Sneak-Peek-Launch-Event-Aug-28-2.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/2025-26-season-launch-gala/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-09-02T10:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-09-02T16:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Salt Spring Forum Presents Author John Vaillant\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;In his recent book: Fire Weather, John Vaillant tells the story of the 2016 Fort McMurray fire, its shocking power and devastating appetite for destruction. From his research into the fire he chronicles the history of the oil industry, climate science and of fire itself creating a fascinating and terrifying tale. Onstage at the Forum, [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/salt-spring-forum-presents-author-john-vaillant/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-08-29T19:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-08-29T21:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"20 \\u2013 25\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/salt-spring-forum-presents-author-john-vaillant/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-07-15T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Salt Spring Painters&#8217; Guild Summer Show and Sale\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;The Salt Spring Painters\\\\' Guild is a diverse group of artists who gather to learn, teach, and meet new friends through art. Our Summer Show and Sale is our major annual event. Come and enjoy paintings in a wide range of subjects and styles by our diverse and talented members, in ArtSpring\\\\'s beautiful gallery! Opening [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/salt-spring-painters-guild-summer-show-and-sale-3/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-07-25T10:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-08-07T16:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Salt Spring Painters Guild\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"TREASURE FAIR CONCERT | ZACHARY STEVENSON &#8220;Dead Ringer&#8221;\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;FRI July 18, 7:30pm | The Victoria Times-Colonist called Zachary a \\u201cdead ringer for dead singers\\u201d for his uncanny ability to replicate the sound and personalities of legendary musicians on stage. In this intimate revue, Zachary shares his unusual musical journey portraying the likes of Hank Williams, Carl Perkins, Jerry Lee Lewis, Phil Ochs and [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Slide_-Zach1920x1080.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/zachary-stevenson-dead-ringer/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-07-18T19:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-07-18T21:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"5 \\u2013 35\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/zachary-stevenson-dead-ringer/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2024-09-09T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Land &#038; Lineage\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Land &amp; Lineage: A Ceremony of Belonging The Imaginelle Mystery School and Naomi Jason present Land &amp; Lineage: An Embodied Ceremony of Belonging. A series of solo prayerformances by local Salt Spring women, showcasing Naomi\\\\'s work as a dancer, choreographer, community mentor and ceremonialist. Land &amp; Lineage is an invitation to tune into the roots [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/land-lineage/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-07-04T19:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-07-04T20:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Imaginelle Mystery School\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"ign&#105;t&#101;&#64;naom&#105;&#106;&#97;so&#110;&#46;co&#109;\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"10 \\u2013 25\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/land-lineage/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-05-16T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Server &#038; Systems Upgrades\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;MON JUN 30- TUE JUL 1 | ArtSpring is upgrading its server and systems on Monday June 30 through Canada Day. People may experience email interruptions in contacting ArtSpring. We anticipate this process will be accomplished in 24 hours, however interruptions may extend up to as long as 72 hours. This does not impact online [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/System-Updates3_-Presentation.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/server-systems-upgrades/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-06-30T00:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-07-01T23:59:59-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"}]\n\n\t\t\n\t{\"slug\":\"venue\",\"prev_url\":\"https:\\/\\/artspring.ca\\/venue\\/artspring-theatre\\/page\\/3\\/?hide_subsequent_recurrences=1&eventDisplay=past\",\"next_url\":\"https:\\/\\/artspring.ca\\/venue\\/artspring-theatre\\/?hide_subsequent_recurrences=1&eventDisplay=past\",\"view_class\":\"Tribe\\\\Events\\\\Pro\\\\Views\\\\V2\\\\Views\\\\Venue_View\",\"view_slug\":\"venue\",\"view