    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t8 events found.\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\n[{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"MICHAEL KAESHAMMER\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Thu Mar 19, 7:30pm | He\\u2019s back! Beloved by ArtSpring audiences and celebrated worldwide, Michael Kaeshammer is a virtuosic pianist, charismatic performer, and master showman. His concerts are high-octane journeys through jazz, boogie-woogie, pop, and soul\\u2014infused with signature charm, playful improvisation, and unstoppable joy. Whether he\\u2019s lighting up the keys in a driving rhythm or [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/8-3.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/michael-kaeshammer-4/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2026-03-19T19:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-03-19T21:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"10 \\u2013 42\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/michael-kaeshammer-4/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-07-16T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"ARROGANT WORMS\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Sat Mar 21, 7:30pm | Canada\\u2019s kings of musical comedy are back\\u2014and still hilariously on point. For over 30 years, The Arrogant Worms have been poking fun at a big, weird world with razor-sharp wit and ridiculous charm. With cult hits like \\u201cCarrot Juice is Murder\\u201d and \\u201cThe Last Saskatchewan Pirate,\\u201d they built a devoted [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/arrogant-worms/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2026-03-21T19:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-03-21T19:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"10 \\u2013 42\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/arrogant-worms/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-09-01T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"BALLET KELONA: Vividus &#8212; Full of Life\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Mon Mar 23, 7:30pm | After opening ArtSpring\\u2019s 25th Anniversary season to acclaim, Ballet Kelowna returns with Vividus: Full of Life\\u2014a bold, high-energy program featuring three dazzling contemporary works by top Canadian choreographers. Alysa Pires\\u2019\\u00a0Vestigesis a sweeping, cinematic reflection on connection in a chaotic world.\\u00a0The Forever Part\\u00a0by Kirsten Wicklund offers a dreamlike meditation on longing, [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Kelowna-Ballet_Slide.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/ballet-kelona-vividus-full-of-life/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2026-03-23T19:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-03-23T21:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"10 \\u2013 42\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/ballet-kelona-vividus-full-of-life/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-09-01T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"FIRE &#038; GRACE\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Sun Apr 19, 2:30pm |Rustic meets refined in this unforgettable concert of classical, folk, and fiddle fire. Guitarist William Coulter and violinist Edwin Huizinga\\u2014both celebrated virtuosos in their own right\\u2014blend the elegance of Bach and Vivaldi with the foot-stomping spirit of Celtic reels, Appalachian waltzes, Bulgarian dances, and tango. \\u00a0 Fire &amp; Grace is a [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/9-2.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/fire-grace/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2026-04-19T14:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-04-19T16:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"10 \\u2013 42\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/fire-grace/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-09-01T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"CHENG\\u00b2 DUO WITH JAMES CAMPBELL\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Tue Apr 28, 7:30 | Siblings Bryan and Silvie Cheng\\u2014known internationally as the Cheng\\u00b2 Duo (pronounced Cheng Squared)\\u2014bring an electrifying chemistry to the stage that transcends classical tradition. Their artistry, praised as \\u201cbrilliant\\u201d (The Sunday Times) and \\u201cabsolutely captivating\\u201d (Pizzicato Magazine), blends youthful energy with technical mastery and emotional depth. JUNO-nominated and celebrated worldwide for [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Cheng-Duo_Slide.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/cheng%c2%b2-duo-with-james-campbell/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2026-04-28T19:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-04-28T21:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"10 \\u2013 42\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/cheng%c2%b2-duo-with-james-campbell/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-09-01T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Vetta Chamber Music Presents: Concert 5 &#8211; CELEBRATION &#8211; Angela Cheng and the Vetta Chamber Players\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;A poignant finale that reflects on treasured memories while opening doors to a bright future. Join these masterful artists in a celebratory program that spans history and highlights Vetta\\u2019s continuing evolution. C\\u00e9sar Franck | Sonata in A major for Violin and Piano Marjan Mozetich | Baroque Diversions for solo viola Johannes Brahms | Piano Quartet [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/vetta-chamber-music-presents-concert-5-celebration-angela-cheng-and-the-vetta-chamber-players/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2026-05-04T14:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-05-04T16:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Vetta\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"30 \\u2013 35\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/vetta-chamber-music-presents-concert-5-celebration-angela-cheng-and-the-vetta-chamber-players/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-04-24T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"MAKANA YOUTH CHOIRS: Spring Concert\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Fri May 22, 7:00pm | Celebrate the joy of youth music making and come check out the Makana Choir\\u2019s Spring concert! As usual with a Makana concert, the choirs learn a variety of repertoire in different styles and languages and cultures. There are some pieces that are quite humorous and others that are thought provoking [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Makana-Spring-Concert_Slide2-1056-x-480-px-1.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/makana-youth-choirs-spring-concert-2/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2026-05-22T19:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-05-22T20:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"2 \\u2013 10\",\"priceCurrency\":\"CAD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/makana-youth-choirs-spring-concert-2/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-10-10T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"TREASURE FAIR CONCERT: Van Django\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Fri Jul 17, 7:30pm | Get ready for a wild ride through the swinging streets of 1930s Paris, by way of Canada\\u2019s west coast. Van Django is a virtuosic string quartet blending gypsy jazz with dazzling improvisation, original tunes, and playful mash-ups that fuse classical, rock, folk, and humour into one joyous sound. Featuring violinist [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/10-2.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/treasure-fair-concert-van-django/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2026-07-17T19:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-07-17T21:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtS