g Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tSat Dec 13, 10am | Giordano’s passionate tragedy stars tenor Piotr Beczała as the virtuous poet who falls victim to the intrigue and violence of the French Revolution. Following their celebrated recent partnership in Giordano’s Fedora in the 2022–23 Live in HD season, Beczała reunites with soprano Sonya Yoncheva as Chénier’s aristocratic lover, Maddalena di Coigny, with baritone […]\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t$15 – $25\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tWed\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t17\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDecember 17, 2025 @ 7:00 pm - 9:00 pm\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\tGISS Music Presents: Musaic\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tGISS Music Presents: Musaic\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Theatre\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tCome kick off Winter Break with GISS Music! Featuring original songs and compositions from the Composition and Production Class and GISPA Music Students, as well as performances from the Choir, Concert Band, Jazz Band and Jazz Combo. Please note - both nights are different nights of music, so to catch all the action you must […]\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t$15\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tFri\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t19\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDecember 19, 2025 @ 7:00 pm - 9:00 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tViva Chorale Presents Christmas in Cornwall\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Theatre\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tCome celebrate the holiday season and support our local foodbank with Viva Chorale's annual holiday concert fundraiser! This year the choir will sing carols interspersed with a lovely story from the UK: The Mousehole Cat. The 