        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t18 events found.\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\n[{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"MONTR\\u00c9AL GUITARE TRIO\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;SUN MAR 16| 2:30pm | Renowned as one of the finest ensembles in the country, the Montr\\u00e9al Guitar Trio (MG3) has been showcasing its virtuosity and captivating stage presence both nationally and internationally for over 25 years. Now, the trio of guitarists is presenting a tribute concert in memory of the great Ennio Morricone. From [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Slide_Montreal_Trio.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/montreal-guitare-trio/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-03-16T14:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-03-16T16:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"5 \\u2013 35\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/montreal-guitare-trio/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2024-09-09T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Artist in Residence Calder White: Rough Cut Performance\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;After a week in residence at ArtSpring, Vancouver-based dancer Calder White invites the community to experience his work in progress. Using life-sized puppets and costume design to obscure the performers\\u2019 identities, Calder White\\\\'s dance-theatre work asks how far we will go to avoid being alone. The characters we encounter in the piece exist at the [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/artist-in-residence-calder-white-rough-cut-performance/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-03-28T15:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-03-28T16:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"JANINA FIALKOWSKA\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;SUN MAR 30 | 2:30pm | For 50 years, concert pianist Janina Fialkowska has enchanted audiences and critics around the world. She has been praised for her musical integrity, her refreshing, natural approach, and her unique piano sound thus becoming \\u201cone of the Grandes Dames of piano\\u201d (Frankfurter Allgemeine.) She is an Officer of the [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Slide_-Janina1920x1080.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/janina-fialjowska/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-03-30T14:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-03-30T16:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"5 \\u2013 35\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/janina-fialjowska/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2024-09-10T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"PIANO HEIST\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;APR 1 | 7:30pm | Lifelong friends, colleagues, and multi-talented musicians Nico Rhodes and Patrick Courtin were shocked and appalled by their realization that piano just isn\\u2019t cool anymore. This set off a quest to redeem the keyboard and reinstate its reputation as the greatest instrument of ALL TIME! Armed with the music of the [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Slide_Piano-Heist.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/piano-heist/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-04-01T19:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-04-01T21:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"5 \\u2013 35\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/piano-heist/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2024-09-09T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Completely Creedence &#8212; A Tribute to CCR\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Completely Creedence Band is a group of talented musicians who share a deep passion for the music of Creedence Clearwater Revival. Completely Creedence love to bring the iconic sounds of CCR to life and delighting audiences with their energetic performances. Completely Creedence pay tribute to one of the greatest rock bands in history. They\\u2019ve dedicated [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/completely-creedence-a-tribute-to-ccr-2/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-04-03T19:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-04-03T22:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"40\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/completely-creedence-a-tribute-to-ccr-2/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-03-05T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"SARAH HAGEN: Goldberg Variations\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;SUN APR 6 | 2:30pm | Canadian pianist Sarah Hagen performs this classic programme featuring Bach\\u2019s formidable Goldberg Variations as part of the celebration of the recent release of her recording of the masterwork. Cherished by many, the Goldberg Variations are emblematic of keyboard virtuosity, rich expression, and hardcore classical interpretation. Sarah will offer a [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Slide_-Sarah1920x1080.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/sarah-hagan-goldberg-variations/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-04-06T14:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-04-06T16:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"5 \\u2013 35\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/sarah-hagan-goldberg-variations/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2024-09-09T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"ENSEMBLE DOULCE M\\u00c9MOIRE\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;THU APR 10 | 7:30pm Let\\\\'s Dance! Dances in the French \\u00a0&amp; Italian Renaissance. Highly stylized and solemn is how we generally imagine early dances, but this concert dans\\u00e9 shows what dances and music were really like in the fifteenth and sixteenth centuries. Omnipresent at court festivities and celebrations, these elegant, refined, and aristocratic dances [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Slide_Doulce.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/ensemble-doulce-memoire/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-04-10T19:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-04-10T21:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"5 \\u2013 35\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/ensemble-doulce-memoire/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2024-09-09T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"WESLI\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;THU APR 17 | 7:30pm | Born to a family of seven children in Port-au-Prince, Haiti, Wesli (Wesley Louissaint) built his first guitar at the age of eight by stringing an old oil can with nylon fishing line. From these humble beginnings, he has gone on to become one of Haiti\\u2019s most inspiring and celebrated [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Slide_Wesli.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/wesli/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-04-17T19:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-04-17T21:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"5 \\u2013 35\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/wesli/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2024-09-09T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"JULIE KIM\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;TUE MAY 6 | 7:30pm | Julie Kim is one of Canada\\u2019s top stand-up comedians. Julie recently toured across North America doing 40 theatre shows with Ronny Chieng (Crazy Rich Asians, The Daily Show with Trevor Noah). She was a gala performer at the 2022 Just for Laughs Festival in Montreal and headlined four sold-out [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Slide_Julie-Kim.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/julie-kim/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-05-06T19:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-05-06T21:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"5 \\u2013 35\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/julie-kim/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2024-09-09T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"RAVEN SPIRIT DANCE: Braiding the Land\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;TUE MAY 13 | 7:30pm | Vancouver-based Raven Spirit Dance presents \\\\'Braiding the Land,\\\\' a trio of performances that follows three powerful female narratives to explore the physical, the spiritual, the rhythms of nature, resilience, and legacy. From the earth to the stars to the innovative collaboration with Indigenous artists in Peru, the evening promises [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Raven_Spirit-Slide.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/raven-spirit-dance/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-05-13T19:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-05-13T21:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"5 \\u2013 35\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/raven-spirit-dance/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2024-09-09T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"OPENING EVENT for Confluence: The Bateman Collection\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Opening Reception May 17 | 4-6pm Join Birgit and Robert Bateman, with special guest speaker Hwiemtun (Fred Roland,) for an introduction to this rare collection at ArtSpring. Open daily from May 18-30, coinciding with Salt Spring\\u2019s own legendary Canadian artist, educator, and conservationist Robert Bateman\\u2019s 95th birthday, comes an extraordinary never-before-seen exhibition Confluence: The Bateman [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Copy-of-Confluence4-Slide-1.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/opening-event-for-confluence-the-bateman-collection/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-05-17T16:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-05-17T18:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Gallery\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-gallery/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"CONFLUENCE: The Bateman Collection\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Free Daily May 18-June 1 | 10am-4pm | This May, coinciding with Salt Spring\\u2019s own legendary Canadian artist, educator, and conservationist Robert Bateman\\u2019s 95th birthday, comes an extraordinary never-before-seen exhibition Confluence: The Bateman Collection at ArtSpring. While Robert is best known for his prolific body of work of highly realistic depictions of wildlife and nature, [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Copy-of-Confluence4-Slide.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/confluence-the-bateman-collection/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-05-18T10:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-06-01T16:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Gallery\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-gallery/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"MAKANA YOUTH CHOIRS SPRING CONCERT\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;SAT MAY 24 | 7:30pm | The Makana Youth choirs are pleased to present their spring concert \\u201cNever One Thing.&quot; Never One Thing is named after a song by May Erlewine that talks about how we can be more than we are perceived to be. We can be both strong and weak at the same [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Makana-Spring-Concert_Slide2.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/makana-youth-choirs-spring-concert/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-05-24T19:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-05-24T21:00:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"2 \\u2013 10\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/makana-youth-choirs-spring-concert/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-03-27T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"MET OPERA: Il Barbiere di Siviglia (Rossini)\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Sat May 31 | The Metropolitan Opera\\u2019s 2024\\u201325 Live in HD season comes to a close with a live transmission of Rossini\\u2019s effervescent comedy on May 31. Russian mezzo-soprano Aigul Akhmetshina headlines a winning ensemble as the feisty heroine, Rosina, alongside American tenor Jack Swanson, in his Met debut, as her secret beloved, Count Almaviva. [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Met-Opera_Barber.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/met-opera-il-barbiere-di-siviglia-rossini/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-05-31T10:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-05-31T13:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"GISS Dance presents Eclipse: A Collection of New Choreography\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Eclipse \\u2013 to obscure one celestial body\\u2019s light by another. Each of the dozen grade 9-12 dancers will have an opportunity to shine brightly in this collection of new choreography from the studio at GISS Dance. This end-of-semester show will include a wide spectrum of emotional and artistic expression. The students study Ballet, Contemporary, Jazz [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/giss-dance-presents-eclipse-a-collection-of-new-choreography/2025-06-05/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-06-05T19:30:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-06-05T21:30:00-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"15 \\u2013 18\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/giss-dance-presents-eclipse-a-collection-of-new-choreography/2025-06-05/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-05-06T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Server &#038; Systems Upgrades\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;MON JUN 30- TUE JUL 1 | ArtSpring is upgrading its server and systems on Monday June 30 through Canada Day. People may experience email interruptions in contacting ArtSpring. We anticipate this process will be accomplished in 24 hours, however interruptions may extend up to as long as 72 hours. This does not impact online [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/System-Updates3_-Presentation.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/server-systems-upgrades/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-06-30T00:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-07-01T23:59:59-07:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"TREASURE FAIR 2025\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;July 16-19 | ArtSpring\\\\'s biggest fundraiser of the year is back! \\u00a0Headlined by a beautiful 2004 Steinway &amp; Sons piano valued at over $68,000, Treasure Fair offers items and experiences at all price points. Furnishings, jewelry, artworks, musical instruments, sporting equipment, collectibles, professional services, and more. Last year\\\\'s Treasure Fair was ArtSpring\\\\'s most successful yet, [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Treasure-Fair-Exchange-Slide2-1920-x-1080-px-2.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/treasure-fair-fundraiser/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-07-16T00:00:00-07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-07-19T23:59:59-07:00\",\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"TREASURE FAIR CONCERT | ZACHARY STEVENSON &#8220;Dead Ringer&#8221;\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;FRI July 18, 7:30pm | The Victoria Times-Colonist called Zachary a \\u201cdead ringer for dead singers\\u201d for his uncanny ability to replicate the sound and personalities of legendary musicians on stage. In this intimate revue, Zachary shares his unusual musical journey portraying the likes of Hank Williams, Carl Perkins, Jerry Lee Lewis, Phil Ochs and [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Slide_-Zach1920x1080.jpg\",\"url\":\"https