 am - June 1, 2025 @ 4:00 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tCONFLUENCE: The Bateman Collection\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Gallery\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tFree Daily May 18-June 1 | 10am-4pm | This May, coinciding with Salt Spring’s own legendary Canadian artist, educator, and conservationist Robert Bateman’s 95th birthday, comes an extraordinary never-before-seen exhibition Confluence: The Bateman Collection at ArtSpring. While Robert is best known for his prolific body of work of highly realistic depictions of wildlife and nature, […]\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSat\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t24\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\tFeatured\n\t\n\t\tMay 24, 2025 @ 7:30 pm - 9:00 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tMAKANA YOUTH CHOIRS SPRING CONCERT\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Theatre\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tSAT MAY 24 | 7:30pm | The Makana Youth choirs are pleased to present their spring concert “Never One Thing.\" Never One Thing is named after a song by May Erlewine that talks about how we can be more than we are perceived to be. We can be both strong and weak at the same […]\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t$2 – $10\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSat\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t31\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\tFeatured\n\t\n\t\tMay 31, 2025 @ 10:00 am - 1:30 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tMET OPERA: Il Barbiere di Siviglia (Rossini)\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Theatre\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tSat May 31 | The Metropolitan Opera’s 2024–25 Live in HD season comes to a close with a live transmission of Rossini’s effervescent comedy on May 31. Russian mezzo-soprano Aigul Akhmetshina headlines a winning ensemble as the feisty heroine, Rosina, alongside American tenor Jack Swanson, in his Met debut, as her secret beloved, Count Almaviva. […]\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tJune 2025\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tThu\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t5\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tJune 5, 2025 @ 7:30 pm - 9:30 pm\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\tGISS Dance presents Eclipse: A Collection of New Choreography\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tGISS Dance presents Eclipse: A Collection of New Choreography\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Theatre\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tEclipse – to obscure one celestial body’s light by another. Each of the dozen grade 9-12 dancers will have an opportunity to shine brightly in this collection of new choreography from the studio at GISS Dance. This end-of-semester show will include a wide spectrum of emotional and artistic expression. The students study Ballet, Contemporary, Jazz […]\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t$15 – $18\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tMon\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t30\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\tFeatured\n\t\n\t\tJune 30, 2025 - July 1, 2025\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tServer & Systems Upgrades\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Theatre\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tMON JUN 30- TUE JUL 1 | ArtSpring is upgrading its server and systems on Monday June 30 through Canada Day. People may experience email interruptions in contacting ArtSpring. We anticipate this process will be accomplished in 24 hours, however interruptions may extend up to as long as 72 hours. This does not impact online […]\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tJuly 2025\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tWed\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t16\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tJuly 16, 2025 - July 19, 2025\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tTREASURE FAIR 2025\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tJuly 16-19 | ArtSpring's biggest fundraiser of the year is back!  Headlined by a beautiful 2004 Steinway & Sons piano valued at over $68,000, Treasure Fair offers items and experiences at all price points. Furnishings, jewelry, artworks, musical instruments, sporting equipment, collectibles, professional services, and more. Last year's Treasure Fair was ArtSpring's most successful yet, […]\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tFri\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t18\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\tFeatured\n\t\n\t\tJuly 18, 2025 @ 7:30 pm - 9:30 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tTREASURE FAIR CONCERT | ZACHARY STEVENSON “Dead Ringer”\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArtSpring - Theatre\t\n\t\n\t\t100 Jackson Avenue, Salt Spring Island, BC, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tFRI July 18, 7:30pm | The Victoria Times-Colonist called Zachary a “dead ringer for dead singers” for his uncanny ability to replicate the sound and personalities of legendary musicians on stage. In this intimate revue, Zachary shares his unusual musical journey portraying the likes of Hank Williams, Carl Perkins, Jerry Lee Lewis, Phil Ochs and […]\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t$5 – $35\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\tPrevious Events\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\tToday\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tNext Events\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tSubscribe to calendar\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tGoogle Calendar\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tiCalendar\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tOutlook 365\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tOutlook Live\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tExport .ics file\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tExport Outlook .ics file\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t( function () {\n\t\tvar completed = false;\n\n\t\tfunction initBreakpoints() {\n\t\t\tif ( completed ) {\n\t\t\t\t// This was fired already and completed no need to attach to the event listener.\n\t\t\t\tdocument.removeEventListener( 'DOMContentLoaded', initBreakpoints );\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\tif ( 'undefined' === typeof window.tribe ) {\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\tif ( 'undefined' === typeof window.tribe.events ) {\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\tif ( 'undefined' === typeof window.tribe.events.views ) {\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\tif ( 'undefined' === typeof window.tribe.events.views.breakpoints ) {\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\tif ( 'function' !== typeof (window.tribe.events.views.breakpoints.setup) ) {\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\tvar container = document.querySelectorAll( '[data-view-breakpoint-pointer=\"e463c839-5bff-4d44-b1de-f8af55be8bdc\"]' );\n\t\t\tif ( ! container ) {\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\twindow.tribe.events.views.breakpoints.setup( container );\n\t\t\tcompleted = true;\n\t\t\t// This was fired already and completed no need to attach to the event listener.\n\t\t\tdocument.removeEventListener( 'DOMContentLoaded', initBreakpoints );\n\t\t}\n\n\t\t// Try to init the breakpoints right away.\n\t\tinitBreakpoints();\n\t\tdocument.addEventListener( 'DOMContentLoaded', initBreakpoints );\n\t})();\n\n{\"tvn1\":\"e096ae2736\",\"tvn2\":\"\"}\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t"
