    ],
    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t18 events found.\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\n[{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"PACIFIC BAROQUE ORCHESTRA: Goldberg Variations\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Tue Dec 2, 2:30pm | Bach\\u2019s\\u00a0Goldberg Variations\\u2014a masterpiece of invention, intricacy, and emotion\\u2014takes on new life in this bold reimagining by director and keyboardist Alexander Weimann. Performed by the acclaimed Pacific Baroque Orchestra, this chamber arrangement transforms a solo keyboard icon into a radiant ensemble experience, breathing fresh colour into Bach\\u2019s timeless score. Weimann\\u2019s orchestration [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/9.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/pacific-baroque-orchestra-goldberg-variations/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-12-02T14:30:00-08:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-12-02T16:30:00-08:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Lobby\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-lobby/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"10 \\u2013 42\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/pacific-baroque-orchestra-goldberg-variations/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-09-01T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"BEAR GREASE THE MUSICAL\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Mon Dec 8, Tue Dec 9, 7:30pm |Get ready for two nights only! Bear Grease dares to reimagine the iconic 1972 musical Grease\\u00a0through a bold and comedic Indigenous lens. With a powwow-powered soundtrack and hip-hop flair, this high-energy, all-Indigenous production transforms classic hits into cultural celebration: \\u201cHopelessly Devoted\\u201d becomes a Round Dance, \\u201cBear Grease Lightning\\u201d [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/10.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/bear-grease-the-musical/2025-12-08/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-12-08T19:30:00-08:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-12-08T21:30:00-08:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"10 \\u2013 42\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/bear-grease-the-musical/2025-12-08/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-09-01T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"MET OPERA: Andrea Chenier (Giordano)\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Sat Dec 13, 10am | Giordano\\u2019s passionate tragedy stars tenor Piotr Becza\\u0142a as the virtuous poet who falls victim to the intrigue and violence of the French Revolution. Following their celebrated recent partnership in Giordano\\u2019s Fedora\\u00a0in the 2022\\u201323\\u00a0Live in HD\\u00a0season, Becza\\u0142a reunites with soprano Sonya Yoncheva as Ch\\u00e9nier\\u2019s aristocratic lover, Maddalena di Coigny, with baritone [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/4-1.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/met-opera-andrea-chenier-giodano/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2025-12-13T10:00:00-08:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-12-13T13:30:00-08:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"15 \\u2013 25\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/met-opera-andrea-chenier-giodano/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-08-28T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"MET OPERA: I Puritani (Bellini)\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Sat Jan 10, \\u00a010am | For gorgeous melody, spellbinding coloratura, and virtuoso vocal fireworks,\\u00a0I Puritani\\u00a0has few equals. On January 10, the first new Met production of Bellini\\u2019s final masterpiece in nearly 50 years\\u2014a striking staging by Charles Edwards, who makes his company directorial debut after many successes as a set designer\\u2014arrives in cinemas worldwide. The [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/5-1.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/met-opera-i-puritani-bellini/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2026-01-10T10:00:00-08:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-01-10T14:00:00-08:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"15 \\u2013 25\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/met-opera-i-puritani-bellini/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-08-28T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"VICTORIA BAROQUE: Of Gods &#038; Men\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Sat Jan 17, 7:30-pm | Metropolitan Opera star soprano Mireille Asselin and acclaimed baritone Jesse Blumberg lead Victoria Baroque on a tour through great love stories of ancient mythology brought to life by the music of Handel, Purcell, and Rameau, with exciting, newly-commissioned Canadian compositions. Founded in 2011 by Finnish-born baroque flutist Soile Stratkauskas, Victoria [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/1-2.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/victoria-baroque-of-gods-men/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2026-01-17T14:30:00-08:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-01-17T16:30:00-08:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"10 \\u2013 42\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/victoria-baroque-of-gods-men/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-09-01T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"The Fretless\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Fri Jan 23, 7:30pm | Winners of a Juno Award and global fans alike, Canada\\u2019s genre-defying string quartet The Fretless is reshaping the way audiences hear traditional music. Rooted in fiddle traditions from around the world but arranged with a chamber music sensibility, their sound is intricate, high-energy, and deeply moving. With six albums and [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/2-2.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/the-fretless-4/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2026-01-23T19:30:00-08:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-01-23T21:30:00-08:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"10 \\u2013 42\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/the-fretless-4/\",\"category\":\"primary\",\"availability\":\"inStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-09-02T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"},{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Buzz Brass: Famous Inspirations\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;Sun Jan 25, 2:30pm | With flair, finesse, and fun, Canada\\u2019s renowned Buzz Brass quintet brings classical masterpieces into bold new focus. In Famous Inspirations, the group reimagines beloved works by Debussy, Ravel, Piazzolla, Dvo\\u0159\\u00e1k, and Liszt\\u2014including the iconic Hungarian Rhapsody No. 2 \\u2014through dazzling original arrangements. These turn-of-the-century classics are transformed through the brilliance [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://artspring.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/3-2.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/event/buzz-brass-famous-inspirations/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2026-01-25T14:30:00-08:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-01-25T16:30:00-08:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring &#8211; Theatre\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;ArtSpring is an 11,800 square-foot, two-level heavy timber structure boasting a 5,200-square-foot exhibition/ multi- purpose area and a 6,600-square-foot, 265-seat theatre.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"url\":\"https://artspring.ca/venue/artspring-theatre/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"100 Jackson Avenue\",\"addressLocality\":\"Salt Spring Island\",\"addressRegion\":\"BC\",\"postalCode\":\"V8K 2V8\",\"addressCountry\":\"Canada\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":48.8518017,\"longitude\":-123.5025882},\"telephone\":\"250.537.2102\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"ArtSpring\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"telephone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"}