    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tArtSpring Presents CHAMBER MUSIC FESTIVAL\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tJuly 21, 2019 - July 27, 2019\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t-\n\t\t\t\t\t\t$5 – $39\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBUY TICKETS\nTimeless Romantics\n7:30pm Friday, July 26 Young Artists’ \n7:30pm/bar 6:30pm Saturday, July 27 Faculty\nProgram\n17th SALT SPRING CHAMBER MUSIC FESTIVAL\nGenerously sponsored by Joan Farlinger and Country Grocer.\nDirector David Visentin and his distinguished faculty welcome bright young musicians from across Canada for a week of intensive coaching and performance.\nFor participation in the July 21-27, 2019 Salt Spring Chamber Music Festival, please contact info@artspring.ca for further information.\nLearn more about the Salt Spring Music Festival\n \n \nFaculty\nPiano\nSarah Hagen\nViolin\nDavid Stewart\nHiroko Kagawa\nSimon MacDonald\nViola\nDavid Visentin\nCello\nPaula Kiffner\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tStart:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t July 21, 2019 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tEnd:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t July 27, 2019 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tCost:\n\t\t\t\t $5 – $39 \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Categories: ArtSpring Presents, Chamber Music Festival\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tAdd to calendar\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tGoogle Calendar\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tiCalendar\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tOutlook 365\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tOutlook Live\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tStart:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t July 21, 2019 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tEnd:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t July 27, 2019 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tCost:\n\t\t\t\t $5 – $39 \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Categories: ArtSpring Presents, Chamber Music Festival\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\n\t\n    \n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Navigation\n\t\t\n\t\t\t« ArtSpring Presents DANIEL LAPP, STEPHANIE CADMAN, & FRIENDS\n\t\t\tArtSpring Presents Chamber Music Festival YOUNG ARTISTS’ CONCERT »\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t"
