      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tMEASHA BRUEGGERGOSMAN-LEE: A Special Gospel Concert\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tFebruary 20, 2026 @ 7:30 pm - 9:30 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t-\n\t\t\t\t\t\t$10 – $42\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tImmersive Experience Week Feb 14-20, 2025 | In concert with Black History Month, engage with a week-long residency celebrating Black artistry and excellence through concerts, open rehearsals, public talks, and educational workshops – culminating in a Brueggergosman-Lee’s Zombie Blizzard as well as a stirring gospel performance with community collaboration.\n\nTo close the week, Measha leads a high-energy gospel concert that promises pure joy and soul-stirring power. Renowned for her versatility across opera, spirituals, jazz, and chamber music, Measha’s gospel roots shine in a performance that will lift spirits and raise roofs.\nA powerhouse soprano with global acclaim, Measha Brueggergosman-Lee has performed on the world’s most prestigious stages—from Carnegie Hall and the Vienna Musikverein to the Barbican and the Kennedy Center. A fierce advocate for music education and social change, Measha’s bold artistry and fearless authenticity redefines what it means to be a classical artist in the 21st century.\nBUY TICKETS\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tDate:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t February 20, 2026 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tTime:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t7:30 pm - 9:30 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tCost:\n\t\t\t\t $10 – $42 \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: ArtSpring Presents 2025-26\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tArtSpring\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\t\t ArtSpring – Theatre \n\n\t\t\t\t\