        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tTREASURE FAIR 2025\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tJuly 16, 2025 - July 19, 2025\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tJuly 16-19 | ArtSpring’s biggest fundraiser of the year is back!  Headlined by a beautiful 2004 Steinway & Sons piano valued at over $68,000, Treasure Fair offers items and experiences at all price points. Furnishings, jewelry, artworks, musical instruments, sporting equipment, collectibles, professional services, and more. Last year’s Treasure Fair was ArtSpring’s most successful yet, and we’re looking to keep the momentum rolling.\nSupport ArtSpring in its mission to enrich, uplift, and connect our community through arts and culture.\nTO REGISTER for bidding and an invitation to the Sneak Peek Gala Event before bidding goes live: treasurefair.artspring.ca\nDONATE: If you wish to  volunteer, please email treasure@artspring.ca\nKEY DATES:\nWed June 18: Last day for donations.\nWed July 2: Online Catalogue goes live.\nWed July 16: Treasure Fair Sneak Peek Gala for registrants and donors: 4pm-6pm\nWed July 16: Online bidding goes live: 6pm\nSat July 19: Bidding closes: 6pm\nFri July 18: Treasure Fair Concert: ZACHARY STEVENSON’s “Dead Ringer.” A tribute to Buddy Holly, Hank Williams, Jerry Lee Lewis and other classics!\nBUY CONCERT TICKETS\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tStart:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t July 16, 2025 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tEnd:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t July 19, 2025 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: ArtSpring Presents 2024-2025\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite:\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t treasurefair.artspring.ca \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tArtSpring\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t