        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tSS Forum: How Did We Get Here?\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tApril 4, 2025 @ 7:30 pm - 9:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\nHow Did We Get Here? And How Do We Survive the Next Four Years\nTariffs…No tariffs…Different tariffs… Annexation…\nOnly a few weeks in to the new Republican/MAGA administration the amount of noise and power mongering directed at Canada from the United States is bewildering and unsettling.\nAre these merely negotiating tactics, or should we be really worried? Will America ever be the same again? Will Canada ever be the same again?\nPeter Klein is executive editor of investigations at NBC News, he was an investigative producer for the CBS newsmagazine 60 Minutes, and won an Emmy for Best Investigative Magazine for his work on the PBS Frontline. He is also well known as a documentary film-maker and as a journalist focusing on national security stories in the U.S.\nHe, and Michael Byers, Forum Chair, author and Canada Research Chair in Global Politics and International Law at UBC, are perfectly placed to shed light on the reasoning behind the actions and proclamations of the current U.S. government towards Canada and the World.\n$20 Members | $25 General\nBUY TICKETS\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tDate:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t April 4, 2025 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tTime:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t7:30 pm - 9:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Rental\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite:\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t saltspringforum.com \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tSalt Spring Forum\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tView Organizer Website\t\t\t\t\t\n\t