        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tWarmland Dance Presents: Unfolding\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tApril 12, 2025 @ 6:30 pm - 8:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t-\n\t\t\t\t\t\t$15 – $35\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\nPresented by Warmland Dance’s Adult Professional Company, Unfolding is an evocative contemporary dance journey that traces the arc of human development from birth to death and beyond, revealing the beauty of transformation, connection, and self-discovery. Leah Burley’s masterful choreography, brought to life by a gifted ensemble, melds contemporary dance with the spiritual depth of anthroposophy.\nUpcoming Performances:\nApril 10 – Artspring, Salt Spring Island\nApril 25 – CPAC, Duncan (returning by popular demand!)\nMay 10 – Dave Dunnett Theatre, Victoria (at Oak Bay High) – A perfect Mother’s Day gift!\nBUY TICKETS\nWhat audiences are saying:\n“I didn’t know what to expect from a local professional troupe, and my expectations were absolutely blown away.”\n“A divine creation—unlike anything I’ve ever seen.”\n“I want to bring everyone I know to experience this incredible piece of art.”\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tDate:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t April 12, 2025 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tTime:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t6:30 pm - 8:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tCost:\n\t\t\t\t $15 – $35 \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite:\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t warmlanddance.ca/unfolding-2025 \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWarmland Dance Company\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\t\t ArtSpring – Theatre \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n100 Jackson Avenue\n\t\n\t