        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tANNUAL DONATION APPEAL Extended to February 28\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tFebruary 28, 2025\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTo off-set the impact of the postal strike, the Government of Canada has extended the window for giving while still being eligible for a 2024 Tax Receipt. If you wish to donate to ArtSpring’s Annual Appeal or top up your donation to receive a new category of engagement benefits, now is the time! How can you give in a way that works best for you?\n\nPlease bring your cheque in person during Box Office hours (Tues-Fri 10am-2pm) by February 28.\nMail your cheque but ensure it is dated for on or before February 28.\nE-transfer your donation to accounts@artspring.ca\nDonate online by credit card or through CanadaHelps at artspring.ca/donate by February 28.\n\nBe sure to review our Donor Categories for exclusive benefits including “first to know” announcements, Donor Appreciation events, VIP meet-and-greets, annual luncheons and benefactor experiences, behind-the-scenes tours and more.\nWe thank you for considering us in your planning and helping us with our mission to enrich, uplift, and connect community through the transformational power of the arts.\nNOTE: Please call us at (250) 537.2102 if you have questions, wish to make a special legacy donation, or sponsor a performance next season.\n \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tDate:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t February 28, 2025 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite:\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t artspring.ca/donate \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tArtSpring\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\t\t ArtSpring – Theatre \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t