        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t25th Anniversary Festival\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tApril 17, 2024 - April 21, 2024\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tApr 17-21 | Get ready for five days of performances, demonstrations, workshops, kids tables, speakers, exhibitions, dance parties, and concerts to celebrate the past, present, and future of arts and community at ArtSpring!  Every inch of the property will be used — from the theatre to the lobby, the gallery to the outside amphitheatre and side meadow.\nSelected workshops require registration through the box office. The Opening and Closing Ceremonies, arts and culture speaker Max Wyman, a special piano performance from Jane Coop and of course the Jim Cuddy concerts have ticket prices.\nThe vast majority of events are free and drop-in, shining the light on local artists, performers, and experts — including our first Community Potluck and Dance Party, featuring Everyday People.\nOur schedule is packed to the brim. Tickets and registrations are online.  Drop by the Box Office for printed hard copies or:\nDOWNLOAD PDF of FULL SCHEDULE\nPrint off, circle your favourites, stick on your fridge!\nPlease visit tickets.artspring.ca for tickets and registration.\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tStart:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t April 17, 2024 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tEnd:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t April 21, 2024 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite:\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t artspring.ca \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tArtSpring\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\t\t ArtSpring – Lobby \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n100 Jackson Avenue\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tSalt Spring Isl