        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tCommunity Potluck & Dance Party\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tApril 18, 2024 @ 6:30 pm - 10:00 pm\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\tEvent Series\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t(See All)\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\nJoin us for ArtSpring’s first Community Finger Food Potluck and Dance Party in our main gallery featuring Everyday People and face and body art by Annie Delorme.\n6:30-8:00pm — Potluck and Face Painting. Contribute and share snacks and mingle with your neighbours. Simply bring a snack dish or finger food dish to share.  Dishes can be dropped off from 5:00pm onward for those who want to take in and enjoy the open stage event in the theatre. Please label dishes for possible allergens GF, DF, nuts etc.\n8:00-10pm — Dance Party with Island favourite cover band Everyday People.\nFree to attend. Cash bar.\nEveryday People is all about the groove. Cherry picking from an eclectic mix of old  hits and newer tunes, Everyday People puts together memorable dance sets that  keep people moving all night long. Featuring Tara Hollingsworth and Billie Woods on  lead vocals, with Mark LeCorre on lead guitar, Dave Campbell on bass, Sig  Schnellert on keys and saxophone, and Bruce Cameron on drums and vocals, the  six-piece rock band exudes positive energy that springs naturally from the  friendships and connections they have made, on and off the stage.  \nFor more information or to book Everyday people, contact us via our Facebook page  https://www.facebook.com/EverydayPeopleRock/\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tDate:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t April 18, 2024 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tTime:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t6:30 pm - 10:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t