        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tTreasure Fair 2023\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tJuly 12, 2023 @ 6:00 pm - July 15, 2023 @ 6:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\nJoin us July 12-15 for the 22nd edition of ArtSpring’s premier fundraising event! With a treasure trove of quality art, collectables, furniture, California vacation home stays, interior design services, vintage pieces, housewares, fine wines, and experience packages, there is something to intrigue everyone — collectors, homeowners, and bargain seekers alike. Help us reach our target of $55,000 by donating items, cash, or purchasing your favourite must-haves!\n\nOnline catalogue opens June 29.\nGala Event at ArtSpring July 12.\nBidding opens online 6 pm July 12.\nBidding closes online 6 pm July 15.\n\nItems also on display in ArtSpring Gallery July 12-15.\n\nContact Catherine Griffiths to volunteer, to donate, or with questions.\ntreasure@artspring.ca\n\nWebsite for submitting, registration, and bidding.\ntreasurefair.artspring.ca\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tStart:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t July 12, 2023 @ 6:00 pm \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tEnd:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t July 15, 2023 @ 6:00 pm \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Categories: ArtSpring Presents, Treasure Fair\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite:\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t treasurefair.artspring.ca \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tArtSpring\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPhone\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t250.537.2102\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tEmail\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\ttickets@artspring.ca\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\