        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\tEvent Series:\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tWeavers & Spinners Guild  2020 Show and Sale\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tWeavers & Spinners Guild  2020 Show and Sale\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tOctober 10, 2020 @ 10:00 am - 3:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t-\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFree\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThis event is a great place to find that special gift, handmade by members of Salt Spring island Weavers and Spinners Guild.\nThe sale offers a wide range of items for the household (those fabulous handwoven tea towels, blankets, rugs); sweaters, hats, scarves, shawls, mitts; handspun yarns and spinning fibres; and much more.\nWe accept credit or debit cards only and ask that shoppers bring their own bag.\nAccess to ArtSpring Gallery is from the rear parking lot only.\nCovid safety precautions for retail sales are in effect. Hand sanitizing is required, but PPE is optional. Please bring your mask in case 2 m distancing becomes awkward.\nPlease join us as we celebrate the fibre arts and share the work of our hearts and minds.\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tDate:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t October 10, 2020 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tTime:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t10:00 am - 3:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tSeries: \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWeavers & Spinners Guild  2020 Show and Sale\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tCost:\n\t\t\t\t Free \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Categories: Rental, Gallery Exhibits & Events\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tSalt Spring Weavers and Spinners Guild\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tView Organizer Website\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\