    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tYouth Art Enrichment: Salish Art with Quentin Harris\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tMarch 2, 2018 @ 10:00 am - 2:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t-\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFree\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\nArtSpring Presents\nYouth Art Enrichment: Salish Art\nwith Quentin Harris (Salish)\nFeb 9, March 2, 9 and 16 – 10 am-2 pm\nGallery showing on March 16 – 2-4 pm\nLimited to 15 students (grades 5-7)\nTo register, please call (250) 537 – 2125 or email events@artspring.ca\nArtSpring is grateful to Country Grocer for their sponsorship of this program.\nStudents will work with carving, painting, storytelling, directed drumming (pow wow drum) and small button blankets. The workshop will be for grades 5-7 and is limited to 10-15 students who have a particular interest in art.\nAbout Quentin Harris (Salish)\nWhile empowering students with an inspired imagination, I aspire to intersect First Nations arts and culture with positive values and truth. Connecting the power of storytelling with visual art, it is my intent to touch the hearts and minds of learners. I am available for teaching sessions, professional workshops, speaking engagements, long-term projects, or commissioned artworks.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tDate:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t March 2, 2018 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tTime:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t10:00 am - 2:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tCost:\n\t\t\t\t Free \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: ArtSpring Presents\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tArtSpring\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\t\t ArtSpring – Gallery \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t