        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tZe Cabaret (at Fulford Hall)\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tSeptember 8, 2012 @ 7:30 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t-\n\t\t\t\t\t\t$25\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\nTickets available at ArtSpring Box Office; show offsite at Fulford Hall.)\nCome and celebrate Salt Spring Pride at the 2nd Annual Ze Cabaret and Dance. The show takes place at Fulford Hall and will feature the Queen of East Van, Isolde N Barron. Joining Western Canada’s star drag queen will be Vancouver-based songtress NiQ, along with Victoria-based comedian Diana Kuch. The cabaret will also feature local talent including fiddler Wesley Hardisty, the Yoga Divas – who will be sure to wow you with their riskee poses, the steamy  troupe, Crème Burlesque, and more… Following the show, DJ Daniel Trump will spin music that will be sure to get you dancing. Purchase your tickets early, as last year’s event sold out. Tickets are available at the ArtSpring Ticket Centre (537-2102) or online. 19+. Wear a daring outfit! Doors 7:30 p.m./show 8:00 p.m. Ticket sales to stop at ArtSpring by Friday, Sept. 7 at 4:00 p.m. when the Ticket Centre closes for the weekend. Tickets then available at Island Star Video. \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tDate:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t September 8, 2012 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tTime:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t7:30 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tCost:\n\t\t\t\t $25 \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Rental\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\t\t Fulford Hall \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n2591 Fulford-Ganges Rd.\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tSalt Spring Island,\n\n\tBC\n\n\n\tCanada\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t