      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tTaste of Salt Spring\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tJune 12, 2016 @ 4:00 pm - 6:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t-\n\t\t\t\t\t\t$20 – $25\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tExperience the best of local food and wine at the annual Taste of Salt Spring event uniting Salt Spring Island chefs, food producers & vintners to create an “island style” savoury evening. Call your friends to meet you at ArtSpring for an indoor & outdoor tasting event!\nA selection of participating Salt Spring restaurants and caterers will be there to showcase their great food. Enjoy beverage tastings from local wineries, the brewery and the cidery as well as other beverage makers. Local food producers will be strutting their stuff along with farmers and growers who will be showcasing the local bounty.\nYour ticket will get you a glass and a tasting plate and you are then free to roam! There will also be a cash bar featuring local products as well as items for purchase directly from the vendors attending.\nTickets are $20 in advance or $25 at the door. Purchase through www.saltspringtourism.com or in person at the Chamber of Commerce & Salt Spring Tourism. Call 250.537.4223 for info.\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tDate:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t June 12, 2016 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tTime:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t4:00 pm - 6:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tCost:\n\t\t\t\t $20 – $25 \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Gallery Exhibits & Events\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tSalt Spring Chamber of Commerce\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tEmail\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tchamber@saltspringchamber.com\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t