        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tTARA CHEYENNE\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tApril 19, 2018 @ 7:30 pm - 9:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t-\n\t\t\t\t\t\t$5 – $25\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWendy D. Photography\nArtSpring Presents\nTara Cheyenne\nI Can’t Remember the Word for I Can’t Remember\nCreated by Tara Cheyenne\n7:30 pm; bar 6:30 pm: 55 minutes without intermission (post-show talkback)\n \n\nWORKSHOP (character development)\nAPR 18 General Public $20 per person\n5:00 pm – 7:00 pm (All ages 12+)\n\n \n \nproudly sponsored by Joan Farlinger andSalt Spring Coffee\nArtistic Director, Tara Cheyenne Friedenberg creates and performs kinetic theatrical expressions of the ever strange and wonderful human experience. I Can’t Remember the Word for I Can’t Remember, is created and performed by Tara Cheyenne Friedenberg in collaboration with Justine A. Chambers, Sarah Chase, John Murphy, and Natalie Purschwitz. Based in Vancouver, Tara has been creating and performing her unique brand of hybrid dance-theatre for the past decade and is known for her expert blending of comedy, dynamic physicality, and character work. Tara has been nominated for several Jessie and Ovation awards for her theatrical choreography and is a 2014 recipient of the Chrystal Dance Prize.\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tDate:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t April 19, 2018 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tTime:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t7:30 pm - 9:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tCost:\n\t\t\t\t $5 – $25 \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: ArtSpring Presents\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\t\t ArtSpring – Theatre \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n100 Jackson Avenue\n\t\n\t\t\n\t