        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tTamar Griggs Photo Exhibit: Faces of Salt Spring\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tApril 27, 2015 @ 10:00 am - 5:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t-\n\t\t\t\t\t\tNo cost, but donations gladly received at the door\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPhotos by Tamar Griggs\nFor over twenty years Tamar Griggs has been photographing her Salt Spring community, passionately drawn to the people, events and changes here. Through her camera, she documents the fleeting moments in our lives and ultimately records history. Over 400 islanders are in Faces of Salt Spring: A Celebration of Community, and there is also a collection of stories by islanders, so viewers can get a glimmer of the people behind the images.  \nCome and see the Faces of Salt Spring. You will be delighted and entertained. It will inspire your own stories!\nNote: This is an intimate exhibit, so bring your reading glasses! Open daily from April 27 – May 5 with the exception of April 29. For more information visit www.facesofsaltspring.com.\n \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tDate:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t April 27, 2015 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tTime:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t10:00 am - 5:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tCost:\n\t\t\t\t No cost, but donations gladly received at the door \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Gallery Exhibits & Events\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tTamar Griggs Photography\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tView Organizer Website\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\t\t ArtSpring – Gallery \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n100 Jackson Avenue\n\t\