      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tSSI’s First Annual Elf & Fairy Faire and Roger Brunt’s Elf Book Launch – FREE ADMISSION\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tNovember 22, 2014 @ 1:00 pm - 5:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t-\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFree Admission\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAttend Salt Spring Island’s First Annual Elf and Fairy Faire and join Roger Brunt as he launches his newest children’s Elf Book.\nStay a minute,\nStay an hour.\nEnjoy a Treat.\nTest Your Elfy Power.\nElf Treats to curl your toes and knock your socks off.\nSee the largest Elf Treasure Box in the Elfy World.\nSee the largest collection of Fairy Doors in Fairydom.\nFind the card(s) you left at Treehouse Treasure Box and win a prize.\nSee all the Elf Tributes left at West of the Moon’s Fairy Door from the last two years.\nWear the Best Costume! Dress up in your best Elf or Fairy Costume. Every child in costume wins a coin from the Elf’s Treasure Box.\nTest yourself in the TROLL’S CHAMBER OF COURAGE AND ENDURANCE.\nLearn to sing The Erskine Song and help us do the Erskine Dance.\nThis is a fun-filled event to help celebrate the elves, and to give them a ROYAL send-off to Santa’s Workshop for the busy Christmas Season! This celebration is also to thank everyone who believes in elves and fairies and wrote to them at the Treehouse Treasure Box, or left a Tribute at the West of the Moon Fairy Door, or even on Mount Erskine! (more than 2000 letters in 18 months!)\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tDate:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t November 22, 2014 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tTime:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t1:00 pm - 5:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tCost:\n\t\t\t\t Free Admission \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category