        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tSS FORUM PRESENTS JOHN HELLIWELL\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tJanuary 11, 2014 @ 7:30 pm - 9:30 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t-\n\t\t\t\t\t\t$15 – $20\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThe Salt Spring Forum presents globally-renown economist and well-being expert John Helliwell. Helliwell, a long-time Professor of Economics at UBC, currently co-directs the Canadian Institute for Advanced Research’s program on Social Interactions, Identity and Well-being. At the global level, Helliwell pioneered the incorporation of well-being and happiness into economic models. His most recent publication The World Happiness Report 2013 has been downloaded more than a million times. Join the Forum for what will be a truly inspiring discussion!\nNote: Trevor Greene, who was initially scheduled to speak this Saturday, has been forced to reschedule his visit for personal reasons. Trevor Greene ticket holders can simply use their tickets to see John Helliwell this Saturday. No ticket exchange is necessary. For a refund, please email saltspringforum@gmail.com.\n \n \n \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tDate:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t January 11, 2014 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tTime:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t7:30 pm - 9:30 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tCost:\n\t\t\t\t $15 – $20 \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Rental\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite:\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t http://saltspringforum.ca/events/an-evening-with-john-helliwell/ \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tSalt Spring Forum\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tView Organizer Website\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t Other \n\t\n\t\