        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tSS Forum: Dr. Aaron Devor, Research Chair in Transgender Studies\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tMarch 11, 2017 @ 7:30 pm - 9:15 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t-\n\t\t\t\t\t\t$15 – $2017\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTransgender and other gender variant people in our society face many challenges. However, as a recent National Geographic cover suggests, a Gender Revolution is taking place. A widespread conversation about gender is happening – and the Forum wants you to be part of it!\nDr. Aaron Devor – the world’s only Research Chair in Transgender Studies, as well as the Founder and Academic Director of the world’s largest Transgender Archives, located at the University of Victoria – joins the Forum in conversation. Dr. Devor has been studying and teaching transgender topics for more than thirty years.\nWhether you are new to the subject of gender diversity, or already know a lot about it, this discussion promises to be informative and inspiring for all! (The event will be moderated by Forum Manager Julian Paquette)\n\n**This event takes place in the ArtSpring gallery. Tickets are limited, so purchase yours early to avoid disappointment!**\nWatch the trailer for the CBC Documentary Transforming Gender:\n\n*Speaker Photo Credit: Brian Sargent\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tDate:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t March 11, 2017 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tTime:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t7:30 pm - 9:15 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tCost:\n\t\t\t\t $15 – $2017 \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Rental\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tSalt Spring Forum\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tView Organizer