        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tSpecial Reception: Two Lads & a Lady\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tJune 28, 2015 @ 10:00 am - 12:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tJoin Curt Firestone, Tom Gilligan, and Margaret Ann Argiro for a special reception with coffees and pastries to celebrate their photo exhibit: Two Lads & a Lady – Photographic Images from Here & There.\nTheir high quality photo art is inspired by places and people from Mexico to India, from the Gulf Islands to the Pacific Ocean. Curt and Margaret Ann are avid travelers, yet reside on Salt Spring Island. Tom, formerly of Salt Spring, brings his work from Gabriola. All three artists have received prior acclamation for their artistic photographs in theDriftwood and have participated in exhibitions on Salt Spring, Gabriola as well as in Nanaimo, Victoria, Puerto Vallarta, San Sebastian and Sidney.\nExhibit open June 24, 12:00 p.m. – 4:00 p.m.; June 25 – 30, 10:00 a.m. to 4:00 p.m. Special reception with coffee and pastries on Sunday, June 28, 10:00 a.m.\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tDate:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t June 28, 2015 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tTime:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t10:00 am - 12:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tCurt Firestone, Tom Gilligan, and Margaret Ann Argiro\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\t\t ArtSpring – Gallery \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n100 Jackson Avenue\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tSalt Spring Island,\n\n\n\tV8K 2V8\n\n\tCanada\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tPhone\n\t\t\t\t\t 250.537.2102 \n\t\t\t\t