        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tSHAKESPEARE’S WAKE: CHRIS (C.C.) HUMPHREYS\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tApril 23, 2016 @ 7:30 pm - 9:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t-\n\t\t\t\t\t\t$5 – $23\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tJoin actor, playwright, novelist and Salt Spring resident Chris (C.C.) Humphreys for an evening of Shakespearean merriment! Fresh from his Bard on the Beach success with Shakespeare’s Rebel, join Humphreys and a troupe of merry players to celebrate the 400th anniversary of Shakespeare’s death with an evening of scenes, songs, sonnets and swordplay. Come revel in theatre and music, beer and blades…as we lay to rest the Bard of Stratford! (Bar opens at 6:30 p.m.)\nActors:\nChris Humphreys\nRobert Ruttan\nJeffrey Renn\nChristina Penhale\nLynda Jensen\nRay Colleran\nReith Humphreys\nGISS Actors:\nJacob Richardson\nHayden Rabson\nGenevieve Lightfoot\nFiona Pirie\nMusicians:\nDebbi P. Toole – mezzo soprano\nDouglas Hensley – lute\nJoanne Whitehead – recorder\nCicela Månsson – soprano\nProudly sponsored by Kate Merry.\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tDate:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t April 23, 2016 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tTime:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t7:30 pm - 9:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tCost:\n\t\t\t\t $5 – $23 \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: ArtSpring Presents\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tArtSpring\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPhone\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t250.537.2102\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tEmail\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\ttickets@artspring.ca\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tView Organizer W