    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tSee Shells – Lobby Art Show\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tMay 1, 2017 - May 31, 2017\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t-\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFree\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\nAn exhibition of photomontage art by Sam Lightman presents 25 images of shells in various depictions, some light-hearted and whimsical, others murky and dark. “The shells themselves present tremendous variety, stunning beauty, and incredible design, but the deteriorating state of the environment they come from sometimes calls for another, less optimistic, approach to their presentation.\n\n\n\n\nPast Shows and Exhibitions\nPhotosynthesis 2015, ArtSpring Gallery, Salt Spring Island, 26 August-08 September 2015\n“Impressions of Hawaii,” two-person show (with Maureen Milburn), Harbour House Hotel, 01-30 June, 2015\n“The Shoreline Project,” two-person show (with Maureen Milburn), Harbour House Hotel, 28 May-30 June, 2014\n“The Shoreline Project,” two-person show (with Maureen Milburn), ArtSpring lobby, 01-30 April 2014\n“Wind Erosion with Shell,” image selected for the “Small Art~Big Impact” Show (juried), Manhattan  Arts International on-line gallery, 18 Dec 2013-18 February 2014\nPhotosynthesis 2013, ArtSpring Gallery, Salt Spring Island, August-September 2013\n“Behind the Masque: A Glimpse of Venice,” Harbour House Hotel, 01-30 June 2013\n“Distinctly Digital,” group show (juried), Coast Collective, Victoria, BC, 03-12 May 2013\nPhotosynthesis 2012, ArtSpring Gallery, Salt Spring Island, August-September 2012\n“Behind the Masque: Two Views of Venice,” two-person show (with Maureen Milburn), ArtSpring lobby, 01-30 April 2012\n“Attachment,” group show, McPherson Playhouse, Victoria, BC, 02 April – 27 May 2012\n“Natural Attachments” Roasting Company Café, Salt Spring Island, selected images from the series; November, 2011 to January, 2012\n“Attachments,” Artepelago group show, Mahon Hall, Salt Spring Island, Sept-Oct 2011\nPhotosynthesis 2011, ArtSpring Gallery, Salt Spring Island, August-September 2011\n“Natural Attachments,” ArtCraft Showcase (juried), one-man show, Community Arts Council, Mahon Hall, Salt Spring Island, August, 2011\n“Seascrapes,” MacDonald Realty Gallery, selected images from the series, Salt Spring Island, June – November 2010\n“Seascrapes,” Café Talia, one-man show, selected images from the series, Salt Spring Island, May, 2010\n“Seascrapes”, ArtSpring lobby, one-man show, Salt Spring Island, April 2010\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tStart:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t May 1, 2017 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tEnd:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t May 31, 2017 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tCost:\n\t\t\t\t Free \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Rental\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite:\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t http://www.samlightman.com/ \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tSam Lightman & Maureen Milburn\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tView Organizer Website\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\t\t ArtSpring – Lobby \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n100 Jackson Avenue\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tSalt Spring Island,\n\n\tBC\n\n\tV8K 2V8\n\n\tCanada\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tPhone\n\t\t\t\t\t 250.537.2102 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tAdd to calendar\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tGoogle Calendar\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tiCalendar\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tO